   "translations": [
    {
     "language_code": "eng",
     "text": [
      "O Hari! Mud and foam may be observed in the waters of Jāhnavī (the Ganges), who possesses an aqueous nature, but the nature of liquefied transcendence never leaves those waters."
     ]
    }
